                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more madly"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ebe6d0e3-572a-4f45-90dd-1e4d3a198121",
                        "entry_id": "7cc5e881-8c9e-3640-aa14-c81dadd9aede",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "madliest"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4cc6eea2-6723-43af-be93-0bfdafc7e653",
                        "entry_id": "7cc5e881-8c9e-3640-aa14-c81dadd9aede",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most madly"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcae4e41-6dbb-3d4c-b6cf-ee99ac16e2f6",
                        "entry_id": "7cc5e881-8c9e-3640-aa14-c81dadd9aede",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a mad manner",
                            "without reason or understanding; wildly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3973950a-6b8c-418e-ab49-54e0a21fce19",
                                "sense_id": "dcae4e41-6dbb-3d4c-b6cf-ee99ac16e2f6",
                                "text": "I'm madly in love with you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27bc88d4-878d-456f-b661-3d195bf8506c",
                                "sense_id": "dcae4e41-6dbb-3d4c-b6cf-ee99ac16e2f6",
                                "text": "But his cries were heard, as he madly grappled with the knives which stabbed him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "442d5450-c714-4a7b-91e8-049b636e9b1b",
                                "sense_id": "dcae4e41-6dbb-3d4c-b6cf-ee99ac16e2f6",
                                "text": "If Austria had not madly invaded Piedmont in 1859, France could not have fought. If, the Pope had not been madly obstinate in rejecting the reforms pressed on him by France, he must have been sustained as a temporal ruler."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93f9b521-ccc7-4d01-9145-c39ed83f8172",
                                "sense_id": "dcae4e41-6dbb-3d4c-b6cf-ee99ac16e2f6",
                                "text": "It is the fact that, for the time, he is bereft of his senses; he is a man who has gone mad. He spends his money madly, he treats his friends madly, he treats himself madly. Those who would love him best if he were not mad are now afraid of him, and often hide themselves from him, and well they may. For this man, in his madness, may hurt them, strike them, kill them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abe764a8-a8d5-4a97-ae10-f24302c8c307",
                                "sense_id": "dcae4e41-6dbb-3d4c-b6cf-ee99ac16e2f6",
                                "text": "Consider, for the love of Heaven, to what you run madly: will you take this viper into your bed?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32f62905-0c86-3f63-ad56-cb28586a8c6f",
                        "entry_id": "7cc5e881-8c9e-3640-aa14-c81dadd9aede",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a mad manner",
                            "angrily"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f908d4fd-5c69-40d2-a1ef-359b9196cecf",
                                "sense_id": "32f62905-0c86-3f63-ad56-cb28586a8c6f",
                                "text": "Diane screamed madly down the phone to the prank caller."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "de469735-b884-3925-8cf3-41b82920ebd8",
                        "entry_id": "7cc5e881-8c9e-3640-aa14-c81dadd9aede",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a mad manner",
                            "extremely surprisingly or unexpectedly"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d6eddc9-4625-4c05-bced-bbbebc3456f1",
                                "sense_id": "de469735-b884-3925-8cf3-41b82920ebd8",
                                "text": "In a way the better procedures you have I think, bizarrely and madly it actually serves to increase rather than decrease the problem"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf30ad34-d39a-4af0-a77b-047552c1a1f7",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cc5e881-8c9e-3640-aa14-c81dadd9aede",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a mad manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "follement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "follement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "294bc38c-fd98-3168-bb4a-d5465083196d",
                                        "entry_id": "bf0fab28-9e0d-3a27-823e-e6070c377783",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière folle, imprudente, excessive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6533b2dd-55a3-417d-b901-4f62ffcd8402",
                                                "sense_id": "294bc38c-fd98-3168-bb4a-d5465083196d",
                                                "text": "Il se souvint tout à coup d'une vieille chronique où il avait, pour flétrir, stigmatiser, juvénaliser les comportements bourgeois, […] projeté le feu rouge des catachrèses les plus imprévues, des synecdoches les plus arbitraires, des antonomases les plus follement tirées par les cheveux, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f60a1eb-c0e6-4fc9-a1e9-447bc57b8eea",
                                                "sense_id": "294bc38c-fd98-3168-bb4a-d5465083196d",
                                                "text": "Malgré moi, les doigts de mes deux mains s'agitèrent follement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c18ca6c-a4bc-48b6-be71-e852770764c4",
                                                "sense_id": "294bc38c-fd98-3168-bb4a-d5465083196d",
                                                "text": "Vers la droite, l’un des aéroplanes piqua follement du nez, se redressa presque perpendiculairement, explosa avec un bruit énorme et s’abîma en flammes dans la mer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4172c926-6844-4d77-92c1-dc972070698f",
                                                "sense_id": "294bc38c-fd98-3168-bb4a-d5465083196d",
                                                "text": "Les appareils de contrôle se mirent à s’emballer tous ensemble et à clignoter follement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eafc587-94d9-466f-ade7-9f4871493f54",
                                                "sense_id": "294bc38c-fd98-3168-bb4a-d5465083196d",
                                                "text": "Les sauterelles se multiplient follement et ne meurent pas. Ça va être une famine mondiale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
